{"case_id": "dev-ad5d05063e", "synthetic": true, "available_at_utc": "2025-05-07T12:10:00Z", "primary": {"source_id": "sim_post_e415d88d6208p", "author_id": "sim_author_980b704c696a", "published_at_utc": "2025-05-07T12:00:00Z", "text": "Closed my whole $OSPELL position today and took the cash.\n\nPart of that cash is going straight into $FARNIC, which I am buying at the open.", "text_sha256": "d654b59b7a7a9104e5d241f7552b8a018c5f0661d02316fe1443f1003b1ff03a", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}, "context": [], "unavailable_context": [], "asset_identity_evidence": [], "evidence_catalogue": [{"evidence_id": "ev_7056a252cb987e5bec0594cc", "source_id": "sim_post_e415d88d6208p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 58}, {"evidence_id": "ev_8b096dbe3a8dd066ecb88c36", "source_id": "sim_post_e415d88d6208p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 139}, {"evidence_id": "ev_b57601cbbbc4811c24ac4c12", "source_id": "sim_post_e415d88d6208p", "start_utf16": 59, "end_utf16": 139}]}
{"case_id": "dev-63a6e614d4", "synthetic": true, "available_at_utc": "2025-05-08T12:10:00Z", "primary": {"source_id": "sim_post_970442968178p", "author_id": "sim_author_a30551a3cb74", "published_at_utc": "2025-05-08T12:00:00Z", "text": "Rebalancing note.\nTrimming $DORVENT by a third after the run.\nHolding $BELMIRA unchanged.\nAdding a new position in $YASKOL at today's price.", "text_sha256": "281da5b8552e914a8e3b0ab342932dc31ffcf9a99d33f99691baa0fca63b1c37", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}, "context": [], "unavailable_context": [], "asset_identity_evidence": [], "evidence_catalogue": [{"evidence_id": "ev_f7d251a4b2cbb02769adc16e", "source_id": "sim_post_970442968178p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 18}, {"evidence_id": "ev_c5e6efbe0298fc598a5f0620", "source_id": "sim_post_970442968178p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 140}, {"evidence_id": "ev_61a7636028b5d41822d08df8", "source_id": "sim_post_970442968178p", "start_utf16": 18, "end_utf16": 62}, {"evidence_id": "ev_f85f5a16e445571dd2ef519b", "source_id": "sim_post_970442968178p", "start_utf16": 62, "end_utf16": 90}, {"evidence_id": "ev_d012ace8a36ee4f477267a8d", "source_id": "sim_post_970442968178p", "start_utf16": 90, "end_utf16": 140}]}
{"case_id": "dev-94c4844bfb", "synthetic": true, "available_at_utc": "2025-05-09T12:10:00Z", "primary": {"source_id": "sim_post_8d1fa7760c13p", "author_id": "sim_author_4659d3b6c7b7", "published_at_utc": "2025-05-09T12:00:00Z", "text": "Last spring I bought $QUENDAL near the lows and sold it for a fourfold gain in the summer. That trade is still my best of the year.", "text_sha256": "362a68ed6a3101416a3cec9012e5c944dce656028fb9bc8ce57ca0c7d55d910b", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}, "context": [], "unavailable_context": [], "asset_identity_evidence": [], "evidence_catalogue": [{"evidence_id": "ev_727b8b61c5d8226590e59329", "source_id": "sim_post_8d1fa7760c13p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 131}]}
{"case_id": "dev-d5f6086c79", "synthetic": true, "available_at_utc": "2025-05-10T12:10:00Z", "primary": {"source_id": "sim_post_86102f780319p", "author_id": "sim_author_dcd9a9f5da00", "published_at_utc": "2025-05-10T12:00:00Z", "text": "My earlier $TRIMBEL trade ended in March when I exited at 1.20 for a small profit.\n\nAfter the reset I am entering $TRIMBEL again today, at a much lower price.", "text_sha256": "ea2cf68932cf025d6374c760d85eeea116d929a0f490510a1fb73e049f307a51", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}, "context": [{"source_id": "sim_post_5deb045a6e37q", "author_id": "sim_author_dcd9a9f5da00", "published_at_utc": "2025-04-10T00:00:00Z", "text": "Taking profit on $TRIMBEL at 1.20 and stepping aside for now.", "text_sha256": "bf9606e2dbe608bc1ae2a188bbad0ee1775c370a2a07fbf7a8dfd1f1fa648b80", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}], "unavailable_context": [], "asset_identity_evidence": [], "evidence_catalogue": [{"evidence_id": "ev_db8bfc9459838e220aca00bf", "source_id": "sim_post_86102f780319p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 83}, {"evidence_id": "ev_bf09b6b07548d1b2e9a93919", "source_id": "sim_post_86102f780319p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 158}, {"evidence_id": "ev_fce23d61f6499b47aa44e2c7", "source_id": "sim_post_86102f780319p", "start_utf16": 84, "end_utf16": 158}, {"evidence_id": "ev_0682b00e3f01b684148a1cae", "source_id": "sim_post_5deb045a6e37q", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 61}]}
{"case_id": "dev-4b04659b2d", "synthetic": true, "available_at_utc": "2025-05-11T12:10:00Z", "primary": {"source_id": "sim_post_3be451f1aff2p", "author_id": "sim_author_f0e392c0b6a7", "published_at_utc": "2025-05-11T12:00:00Z", "text": "We sold out of $MOSKAR back in January and have not looked back.\nThis week our desk is accumulating $WENDRIX instead.", "text_sha256": "fe7b7800bf8dc53caa6dbc062f8980e9af9709b8df3915cafa5a53a25ec558a6", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}, "context": [], "unavailable_context": [], "asset_identity_evidence": [], "evidence_catalogue": [{"evidence_id": "ev_b5e626ac86270ea4d1691167", "source_id": "sim_post_3be451f1aff2p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 65}, {"evidence_id": "ev_f17350f0eb9834fe0f4fef2c", "source_id": "sim_post_3be451f1aff2p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 117}, {"evidence_id": "ev_9084c23b6e79b2f00b0875c8", "source_id": "sim_post_3be451f1aff2p", "start_utf16": 65, "end_utf16": 117}]}
