{"case_id": "dev-565cba2faf", "synthetic": true, "available_at_utc": "2025-05-17T12:10:00Z", "primary": {"source_id": "sim_post_c23ef65da6e5p", "author_id": "sim_author_004e4a6d4014", "published_at_utc": "2025-05-17T12:00:00Z", "text": "Should the governance vote pass next week, we would begin accumulating $CORVATH. The vote has not taken place yet.", "text_sha256": "881df1128508caa3a8079d0e4ea0b4aa88cacc4514fe35f96d0f2d5e56486756", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}, "context": [], "unavailable_context": [], "asset_identity_evidence": [], "evidence_catalogue": [{"evidence_id": "ev_47b86a92c8d8155c238148b7", "source_id": "sim_post_c23ef65da6e5p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 114}]}
{"case_id": "dev-04b2d44233", "synthetic": true, "available_at_utc": "2025-05-18T12:10:00Z", "primary": {"source_id": "sim_post_18225e0d8c83p", "author_id": "sim_author_2c1038a4f832", "published_at_utc": "2025-05-18T12:00:00Z", "text": "$BENTRA could trade at three times its current price by next year if adoption keeps pace. That is a scenario I find plausible, nothing more.", "text_sha256": "bc2372e98c956d366016913795fcb96809fafd736dfdd286db5d8ce184674742", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}, "context": [], "unavailable_context": [], "asset_identity_evidence": [], "evidence_catalogue": [{"evidence_id": "ev_d137a9487d255d282ed5b415", "source_id": "sim_post_18225e0d8c83p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 140}]}
{"case_id": "dev-477a2ce0e0", "synthetic": true, "available_at_utc": "2025-05-19T12:10:00Z", "primary": {"source_id": "sim_post_9ba459469bfcp", "author_id": "sim_author_548b027c07b5", "published_at_utc": "2025-05-19T12:00:00Z", "text": "I am optimistic about the wider market this quarter, and $ORLEX in particular looks likely to benefit from the network upgrade.", "text_sha256": "17d1ee3484e2c09ff47ab6754c6a83e196f73ea7a47c295e7bdc8c5b166c1bfe", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}, "context": [], "unavailable_context": [], "asset_identity_evidence": [], "evidence_catalogue": [{"evidence_id": "ev_f7d1d87893ce7229eac01ca1", "source_id": "sim_post_9ba459469bfcp", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 127}]}
{"case_id": "dev-6063f55a21", "synthetic": true, "available_at_utc": "2025-05-20T12:10:00Z", "primary": {"source_id": "sim_post_78b921de8024p", "author_id": "sim_author_fa4c064e7ca0", "published_at_utc": "2025-05-20T12:00:00Z", "text": "Doing my best impression of the usual promoters today: \"$GLIMMERX is the last chance to get rich, buy now or cry later.\" Please do not take this seriously; I own none and want none.", "text_sha256": "76bf0eb8da829aab812da5a0bc88916f113078144a58f3bcbe247c9a9e1401e3", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}, "context": [], "unavailable_context": [], "asset_identity_evidence": [], "evidence_catalogue": [{"evidence_id": "ev_43114bac3fea59c891816906", "source_id": "sim_post_78b921de8024p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 181}]}
{"case_id": "dev-8ddea3f0f4", "synthetic": true, "available_at_utc": "2025-05-21T12:10:00Z", "primary": {"source_id": "sim_post_f638f55cc518p", "author_id": "sim_author_69b16c3e8240", "published_at_utc": "2025-05-21T12:00:00Z", "text": "Found this call from two years ago while cleaning up my bookmarks. Interesting to see how confident people were back then.", "text_sha256": "807f164960c4da1192e1c9bfdae80072da1507197adea17c5a7bbc39f6a2c897", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}, "context": [{"source_id": "sim_post_2eb8ee919e5fq", "author_id": "sim_author_f17d38a6e834", "published_at_utc": "2025-04-21T00:00:00Z", "text": "Buy $FENWORT under 0.30. This is my highest conviction idea.", "text_sha256": "0712e706545c7da21b29bc5e2a69b6adb4596790c9bd2aab9e495c648034c3a9", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}], "unavailable_context": [], "asset_identity_evidence": [], "evidence_catalogue": [{"evidence_id": "ev_30453f03ce5106ea7b19c868", "source_id": "sim_post_f638f55cc518p", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 122}, {"evidence_id": "ev_16f1c8009548577756eb75c9", "source_id": "sim_post_2eb8ee919e5fq", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 60}]}
{"case_id": "dev-f55fc4c31c", "synthetic": true, "available_at_utc": "2025-05-22T12:10:00Z", "primary": {"source_id": "sim_post_82cc18813c9ep", "author_id": "sim_author_e135f6d2395a", "published_at_utc": "2025-05-22T12:00:00Z", "text": "A large account wrote this morning, \"Load up on $TASKERON before Friday.\" I am passing it along without endorsement; I have not bought and do not plan to.", "text_sha256": "7ed25a45351ef9f395dbbccb224df21b2ecf686f53c0b59cd7f2ad262a717397", "capture_scope": "FULL_TEXT"}, "context": [], "unavailable_context": [], "asset_identity_evidence": [], "evidence_catalogue": [{"evidence_id": "ev_5fb1248f89aed47dd629c805", "source_id": "sim_post_82cc18813c9ep", "start_utf16": 0, "end_utf16": 154}]}
